%% Additional Chapter 3 diagram: Training objective and optimisation
flowchart TB
    A[Sliding training windows<br/>T = 96, stride = 16] --> B[Residual LSTM-VAE forward pass]
    B --> C[Prediction x_hat_t]

    C --> D[Reconstruction loss<br/>Smooth L1 on observed points only]
    C --> E[Residual penalty<br/>discourage unnecessary prior changes]
    B --> F[KL divergence<br/>posterior toward standard normal]

    G[Beta warm-up] --> F
    D --> H[Total objective]
    E --> H
    F --> H
    H --> I[AdamW optimisation]
    I --> J[ReduceLROnPlateau scheduler]
    I --> K[Gradient clipping]
    J --> L[Updated model parameters]
    K --> L

